#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:5 d326b8e173b2462782bcda3d8a534887
msgid "SkyRocket with other Ground Stations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:7 5f0f20027fa649b0a395a11a19438fb9
msgid ""
"The SkyViper has its own app that runs on android or iOS, but to access "
"the full capabilities of the ArduPilot firmware you may prefer to use "
"another ground station package. The SkyViper can work with any of the "
":ref:`ArduPilot compatible ground stations <common-choosing-a-ground-"
"station>` including :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-"
"planner>`.  For any of them:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:9 74dd1d676c0c4c5b8b77f9c1b5df61a0
msgid "connect your PC/tablet/phone to the drone's wifi access point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:10 cdbea3d8774b402695439bd5ae8d3841
msgid ""
"on the ground station set the connection type to \"UDP\" and press "
"connect.  If asked, set the port to \"14550\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:15 6bab81e554394b298d24650323f9d88e
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner, the video from the SkyViper can be made to "
"appear in the “HUD” (the Heads Up Display which normally shows the blue "
"and green attitude display) The SkyViper uses UDP broadcasts you can "
"connect from multiple devices at once. Use the following setup sequence:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:17 108a2bbafc98437098a006553384fb9f
msgid ""
"Install the gstreamer 1.0-x86_64-1.9.2.msi package from "
"[here](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/data/pkg/windows/1.9.2/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:18 63f3d205a0f849e19af519d206bdfaef
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, right mouse click on the HUD and select \"Video\" "
"then \"Set GStreamer Source\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:19 cef4eff503c748ea9baa83bd9fb6552b
msgid "Change the IP setting and port for the SkyViper video in Sonix board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:21 2aa1efd1626942d9ac53fe6758f98390
msgid ""
"**Default Setting in MP** rtspsrc "
"location=rtsp://192.168.1.133:8554/video1 ! application/x-rtp ! "
"rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink "
"name=outsink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:24 86f8ff3bad7443138aaa5f597bbf312e
msgid ""
"**Setting for SkyViper Video MP** rtspsrc "
"location=rtsp://192.168.99.1:5600/video1 ! application/x-rtp ! "
"rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink "
"name=outsink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:27 76b035e3471f4bcdb4f6e80c1e03a5fe
msgid ""
"Launch Mission Planner after the SkyViper has been powered up and the "
"laptop WiFi has been connected to the drone’s wifi access point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:31 3907e1f68a82424cbd90016834cf9ed6
msgid ""
"The SkyViper uses MAVLink2 by default, which does not work with some "
"older GCS software (such as Tower) that only use MAVLink1. To use these "
"older GCSs you may need to change the :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` parameter to 1 from the default of 2."
msgstr ""

